    "_postman_id": "ba3a1c2b-61fd-46d9-b25d-f0306fd47942",
    "name": "USDA FAS Open Data Services ESR API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Best-effort OpenAPI 3.1 description of the USDA Foreign Agricultural\nService (FAS) Open Data Services, derived from the public Swagger 2.0\ndocument at https://apps.fas.usda.gov/opendata/swagger/docs/v1 and the\nOpendataWeb portal at https://apps.fas.usda.gov/opendataweb/home.\nThe API exposes three datasets:\n  - ESR: U.S. weekly Export Sales of Agricultural Commodity Data\n  - GATS: Global Agricultural Trade System (Census and UN Trade)\n  - PSD: Production, Supply and Distribution\nAuthentication uses an `API_KEY` header issued via api.data.gov.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: USDA Foreign Agricultural Service",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
